Design tokens
-------------

app/v2/src/design-system/tokens.json is an unchanged copy of
content/brand/colors/tokens.json of LazurioTemplates/design-system at the
release named in app/v2/src/design-system/lock.json (v1.0.0), and
app/v2/src/design-system/theme.ts adapts the reading of the tokens and the
contrast ratio of its app/v1/src/tokens.ts; Copyright (c) 2026 Lazurio
contributors, MIT. An Organization that syncs the copy from its own design
system takes that design system's license with it.

Third-party material
--------------------

No font, image, icon set or other third-party asset is distributed in this
repository.

- Fonts. The tokens name "Inter" and "JetBrains Mono" in their font stacks;
  a browser uses them only when they are installed, otherwise the system
  font. No font file is shipped or loaded from a CDN. Both fonts are
  licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 by their authors
  (https://github.com/rsms/inter, https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono).
- Dependencies. The viewer installs its npm dependencies at preparation time
  (app/v2/package.json, app/v2/bun.lock); they are not part of this
  repository and keep their own licenses: Astro, Starlight and
  @astrojs/check (MIT), @lazurio/module-kit (MIT), TypeScript (Apache-2.0),
  Biome (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and @types/bun (MIT). The static build contains
  the code Astro, Starlight and Pagefind generate for the pages.
